   "question": "Does the Done-when's 'one GET of the record' cover RecordDetailView's sequential ?populate= re-read? The ruling calls it a list, but it is the page's own $expand record read, sent again after the first settles when objectDef changes identity. Sharing in flight cannot absorb it, so with this PR a record open still reads the record 3 times as 2 different requests.",
