  "class: a · reach: public door, the console record page. A full reload of a showcase_task record (Playwright request count, 4 of 4 runs on both base 5a2a6ab and this branch) sends GET /api/v1/data/showcase_task?populate=...&top=1&filter=id twice in sequence; one read is expected. Evidence: instrumented build marks for RecordDetailView's record-load effect show every dependency equal between the two runs except objectDef (a new identity), so this is the AGENTS.md #10 identity-dependency class. The re-read also re-requests the same $expand list. Dedupe words: record page populate read twice, RecordDetailView objectDef identity re-read, duplicate expand record GET",
